Wisp assets (icons, bar glyphs, mark, wordmark and their SVG sources under
assets/) are original work made for this project, drawn by hand as SVG
path data. No stock packs, icon fonts, emoji or AI image generation.

Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
The code that builds them (scripts/assets/) is MIT, as is the rest of the
repository (see ../LICENSE).
